### Slaves Online AND in OP
## Slave 0
net ek1914-oper    lcec.m0.EK1914.slave-oper   => and2.0.in0
net ek1914-online  lcec.m0.EK1914.slave-online => and2.0.in1
net ek1914-ready   and2.0.out                  => faultlatch.34.monitor
setp faultlatch.34.id 110
net startup-gate faultlatch.34.inhibit
net gate-ek1914 faultlatch.34.fault-interlock  => faultlatch.6.inhibit faultlatch.7.inhibit faultlatch.8.inhibit faultlatch.9.inhibit
